#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:14
#: dcb289417c974d3d9bbedb6f5754e397
msgid ""
"The `RockBLOCK "
"<https://www.groundcontrol.com/en/product/rockblock-9603-compact-plug-and-"
"play-satellite-transmitter/>`__ satellite modem allows for a global "
"(including polar regions) MAVLink connection to an ArduPilot vehicle. This "
"uses the `Iridium SBD data service "
"<https://www.iridium.com/services/iridium-sbd/>`__."
msgstr ""
"`RockBLOCK <https://www.groundcontrol.com/en/product/rockblock-9603-compact-"
"plug-and-play-satellite-transmitter/>`__ 卫星调制解调器允许通过 MAVLink 与 ArduPilot "
"飞行器建立全球（包括极地地区）连接。它使用 `Iridium SBD 数据服务 "
"<https://www.iridium.com/services/iridium-sbd/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:12
#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:18
#: 836180e110e544cfb12669881ba8d853 a3a152724af84eb5be9c0da9b584c0ac
#: d658616a53264dbabc1c32f6c737a4e3 eb4d9daa667c4114a9a9947797aacef6
#: ee55b9dcb52b41db8c0aa149eb420802 f2f313f894af46eea9b78f06eac489cc
msgid ""
"Due to the very low datarate of the RockBLOCK, there are a few key "
"limitations:"
msgstr "由于 RockBLOCK 的数据速率极低，存在以下几项关键限制："

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:14
#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:20
#: 19850db5478a4850b389c65178fbc0f1 1ebe65dcc83f40daa36aa34fc368c365
#: 7f2ed067a1df45bb8cd8e2afaa6bde50 90891e74be634cc699b4f3ee7f2f5006
#: b81c86a3883f48deab3275a73822140d d0988a4353fd480b95365f7bb21d846a
msgid ""
"A single `HIGH_LATENCY2 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HIGH_LATENCY2>`__ packet will be"
" sent every ``RCK_PERIOD`` sec. This will give basic position and status "
"information."
msgstr ""
"每隔 ``RCK_PERIOD`` 秒发送一个 `HIGH_LATENCY2 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HIGH_LATENCY2>`__ "
"数据包，提供基本位置和状态信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:15
#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:21
#: 07d16f29cb15420a81f7774c634b9679 752fb5f351c44c03afa2d516aab07340
#: 84ad16ad9aad48dc86fcd4a9937004b2 a8ecfe67f9c74e59af8d1e577d9ecacc
#: c91071417a3e46418923806a3ec2809a e670c87b82b64b7196f5755fcd1676b5
msgid ""
"No heartbeats, statustexts, parameters and waypoints will be sent from the "
"vehicle to the GCS."
msgstr "不会从飞行器向地面站发送心跳包、状态文本、参数和航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:16
#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:22
#: 028f74771cd44d70a09489a5c8216c15 44c5296aab8d41e0917b09e9a6e97bd0
#: 47731039d31b40f19669bbfa94e1f94f 57bb7024e2b1476b8230d5cd0b73e27d
#: ba1451365f834c97978b1e543af1c724 edf17bcb2ba04c88ad6e301491183563
msgid ""
"The RockBLOCK only sends a subset of MAVlink messages (see below list) from "
"the GCS to Vehicle. Parameters and waypoints will not be sent."
msgstr "RockBLOCK 仅支持从地面站向飞行器发送部分 MAVLink 消息（见下列清单），不支持参数和航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:17
#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:23
#: 03331cd672f84e1d819de18062e77823 33516e0e50eb45e4bd2ff2ed5c0104ea
#: 6271fcd4507f4c5db7078f3c56cec597 97f12891670d4b61b75fb0cdcbd15750
#: c620955c48fe4b5e97a8954f697c9977 edd7e806282b4cfb829a72f08eb76396
msgid ""
"Only 1 command message can be sent per ``RCK_PERIOD`` from the GCS to "
"vehicle. Any additional commands will overwrite the previous command"
msgstr "每个 ``RCK_PERIOD`` 内最多从地面站向飞行器发送 1 条命令消息。任何额外命令将覆盖前一条命令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:19
#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:25
#: 07757c7e49fc4acdb190684f13c05130 9cc2a985ece6418889c1d23eb2a9e8b9
#: ad80a507e650430883438d315256c71d b288b6b2c2aa49d8af5fc2b537eeff43
#: bc28ab7faa47432fb713cf01501f95f7 c26f03d24b98445a90a5bc3982aba736
msgid ""
"In practice, this means the RockBLOCK can only be used whilst monitoring a "
"vehicle during automated flight modes. Any sort of manual control (outside "
"of low-rate GUIDED mode \"fly to\" locations) is not possible."
msgstr ""
"实际上，这意味着 RockBLOCK 只能在自动飞行模式下用于监控飞行器。任何形式的手动控制（低速率 Guided 模式「飞到指定位置」除外）均不可行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:28
#: 6d857e97effb47168a90992c6f72313b
msgid ""
"The RockBLOCK has a latency of 20-60 seconds and is only able to send 1 "
"message per 30 second period (or greater). This period is configurable via "
"the ``RCK_PERIOD`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"RockBLOCK 的延迟为 20-60 秒，每 30 秒（或更长时间）只能发送 1 条消息。此周期可通过 ``RCK_PERIOD`` 参数配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:21
#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:31
#: 196f84218cde4b2fa5e57e8a893f63ab 5523797b7a24449d95eb8b480c658853
#: 8b5b8af32a8248daba96ec502c7a45ae 97501d0f3e46450195d9d1558fe6b690
#: c2d723c2332c4cffa7e44e288e905525 f4d344ad281e4040af30cb85d6c27721
msgid ""
"If desired, the RockBlock can automatically activate on loss-of-GCS-"
"telemetry. This is done by setting the ``RCK_FORCEHL`` parameter to 2. The "
"RockBLOCK will then automatically activate when telemetry is lost for "
"``RCK_TIMEOUT`` seconds. When telemetry is restored, the RockBLOCK will "
"deactivate."
msgstr ""
"如需要，RockBlock 可在失去地面站数传时自动激活。将 ``RCK_FORCEHL`` 参数设为 2 即可实现。当数传中断超过 "
"``RCK_TIMEOUT`` 秒后，RockBLOCK 将自动激活。当数传恢复后，RockBLOCK 将自动停用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:148
#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:35
#: 11a8a3701b0f42919deb59b9e4e1bab3 21799aeabd2b4452a2df584b0c72721d
