#: a093c1ab4cae4928a6f79ac12359c27a d5a3da1a6671478db38973d4c3bf5a52
msgid ""
"Any modem using the Iridium 9602 or 9603 chipset *should* work, though only "
"the RockBLOCK 9603N modem has been tested."
msgstr ""
"任何使用 Iridium 9602 或 9603 芯片组的调制解调器 *应该* 可以工作，但目前仅测试过 RockBLOCK 9603N 调制解调器。"

