#: e26672cde7b44ed9be29681617a19a81
msgid ""
"This page is split into two sections: The Rockblock 9603 and the Rockblock "
"9704. Note these modems have different setups and parameters."
msgstr "本页分为两部分：Rockblock 9603 和 Rockblock 9704。注意这两种调制解调器的设置和参数各不相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:9
#: 12be6b1373654388a5dc8d6070ce0b47 80f30212cfe248af8c947ba8e2f3addc
#: 890d728aa0744fe086137e807321af99 d274772a8f01402fa580c62d92454a2f
#: fa7cde97fab146e98326c5146e5d5b7e
msgid ""
"The `RockBLOCK <https://www.groundcontrol.com/products/>`__ satellite modem "
"allows for a global (including polar regions) MAVLink connection to an "
"ArduPilot vehicle."
msgstr ""
"`RockBLOCK <https://www.groundcontrol.com/products/>`__ 卫星调制解调器可为 ArduPilot "
"载具提供全球范围（包括极地地区）的 MAVLink 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:25
#: 34b438cb121a4498ab5d2538e98cc917 5eb4e0426f4f4ddcbb9c6b74a9a7e9dd
#: 675a4fe9238e4fa1b4ffa698fd6350df b5619c0b98134ab8b18002b21fb6cdc3
#: bb79dcfd28194ab295eff3f87e0c102c
msgid ""
"The RockBLOCK 9704 is the current and recommended model. It has a faster "
"transmit time and lower power consumption than the 9603 model."
msgstr "RockBLOCK 9704 是当前推荐的型号。与 9603 型号相比，它的发送时间更短、功耗更低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:54
#: 1b71a6b2e34e4cd8a87fe2b244224b0c 251bc05593db4f5da37d345435a05f62
#: 40df7c7459b34100b6ef5b0b5d4356bd 9f5334bf7e074ce9b2b1c200e2817693
#: a9cd3816f35444f4be251b89cdc7d25d
msgid "RockBLOCK 9704"
