#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:59
#: 1dc9a9d30af44aef91181e595d1b87ac 304b829fc6974458a8b80cd2342b4eda
#: 5b91b620faf64585864e880fe80dd5cc df5b86ae87d04001be7b9bce77591554
#: f832c7da9c214c1998eca5117e4f1ea5
msgid ""
"The `RockBLOCK 9704 "
"<https://www.groundcontrol.com/product/rockblock-9704/>`__ satellite modem "
"uses the `Iridium IMT data service "
"<https://www.iridium.com/services/iridium-messaging-transport/>`__."
msgstr ""
"`RockBLOCK 9704 <https://www.groundcontrol.com/product/rockblock-9704/>`__ "
"卫星调制解调器使用 `Iridium IMT 数据服务 <https://www.iridium.com/services/iridium-"
"messaging-transport/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:62
#: 362958ae2b1c45b4b12d09e9e1da3ff9 5bb1362bbcfd458a992b810f1ea487a0
#: 8be6a139133140f4a561d51981aac37e bd795b27c9994facb0394745801ac7d3
#: f2a46b9d1ce447e3b3e8fd779522ffaf
msgid ""
"The RockBLOCK 9603 has a latency of less than 10 seconds and can send 1 "
"message per 30 second period (or greater). This period is configurable via "
"the ``RK9_PERIOD`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"RockBLOCK 9603 的延迟小于 10 秒，每 30 秒（或更长）周期可发送 1 条消息。该周期可通过 ``RK9_PERIOD`` 参数配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:65
#: 3559d4ca114242a491f4a3408d2cd1cd 3ec020043e134f9e95e9b138f2e721b2
#: 8a368d7927bd47dfb6525492c0d88946 99bda8c159cb45b7be54e4026687c300
#: e66ca06d86d844ab80dd1cdfdb0e13cd
msgid ""
"Any modem using the Iridium 9704 chipset *should* work, though only the "
"RockBLOCK 9704 modem has been tested."
msgstr "任何使用 Iridium 9704 芯片组的调制解调器 *应该* 都能工作，但只有 RockBLOCK 9704 调制解调器经过了测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:70
#: 1942f4ec20c047c8a4a49710acf138c7 4fd25392381e4ea7b61b5413e6bb58ff
#: 50356e3296aa49a28624d95c4afa2765 944a899033d14b0f9f354a17600d5b43
#: fc2d2307d02f49c58eaed372a5160fbc
msgid ""
"Connect the RockBLOCK modem to a spare UART on the flight controller. Only "
"the +5V (V_IN+), RX, TX and GND (V_IN-) lines need to be connected."
msgstr ""
"将 RockBLOCK 调制解调器连接到飞控的空闲 UART。只需连接 +5V (V_IN+)、RX、TX 和 GND (V_IN-) 线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:71
#: 813ffa70032941c5a07451279163c8d8 88f427a17b194722be872f237d961bdf
#: 89c989856af24435a013335919ec187f 9dddee6086644d39808eb94901efdc87
#: f25a853679a74f3daf949e176c0e84e6
msgid ""
"Connect the RockBLOCK I_EN pin to a relay output on the flight controller."
msgstr "将 RockBLOCK 的 I_EN 引脚连接到飞控的继电器输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:72
#: 152d90fcbc3c4dc99b3615e264b40e1f 54a849c532864845b9756d6db1f891e3
#: 60d881f84e804e59abd6aa9e7444377e a019fff2de334a349abccfecde22a196
#: f3c47755ca184cfa87313413ca37964a
