"Connect the RockBLOCK I_BTD pin to a GPIO input on the flight controller."
msgstr "将 RockBLOCK 的 I_BTD 引脚连接到飞控的 GPIO 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:73
#: 137c2f6a4d79458ea486abce24d463e5 6150772a37eb4031950c293c19300b5c
#: 6f8e2469b2714600b4e4c993a3d15ecf 8758c34d827e46bfb4cc20c4723303ac
#: e6002cf0a2c145a09a158562c0006cd1
msgid "Ensure the modem is activated in your RockBLOCK account."
msgstr "确保调制解调器已在你的 RockBLOCK 账户中激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:74
#: 42ce300e151b43f4b05a77cf13a9e105 5423336797fe4437b0efa06ea12bebda
#: 93905077297447a0bfe47a2b122b0282 b35075423b6942738e1a5b02d1b48f80
#: eee029a595f34481a65ca53bfcaeccdc
msgid ""
"Copy the `Ardupilot RockBLOCK Lua script "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/RockBlock-9704.lua>`__"
" to the flight controller's SD card."
msgstr ""
"将 `Ardupilot RockBLOCK Lua 脚本 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/RockBlock-9704.lua>`__"
" 复制到飞控的 SD 卡上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:156
#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:75
#: 18da414a93a143278300e657eeebd631 2a639396637144a9817fb62a76bcee2e
#: 3dae5030a1b0431abb5954cf601b1342 57e641886612410cb8bded7922e03eb0
#: 5bffb333fad44dfe88bbe305874bbb9a 63811ca317ce4b7eb9d5bc9821acb14f
#: 9b869ac0c74a43678014fcf837919d9c a0bc87e9c95947258286ddc7f0e3d36c
#: ab43f2f1c0694cf6ab5dfcd559e8a75d f15b4a8e85a94e4baa6aee715d569190
msgid ""
"Ensure :ref:`LUA Scripts<common-lua-scripts>` are enabled and the RockBLOCK "
"UART is set as a scripting UART (``SERIALx_PROTOCOL=28``). Reboot the "
"autopilot."
msgstr ""
"确保已启用 :ref:`LUA 脚本<common-lua-scripts>`，并将 RockBLOCK 所在 UART 设置为脚本 "
"UART（``SERIALx_PROTOCOL=28``）。重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:76
#: 660050e24b9f4ab5878b355c67e30a60 88591164d58b466d8da64569641f360f
#: 9c22e28ff8e545fdb850fcc77a293485 f40f02dcb21740a9be79128ed2ee295d
#: ff87040b000743da908bc8523b82399d
msgid ""
"Set ``SCR_SDEV_EN=1`` to enable a scripting serial port and set one to "
"MAVLink High Latency (``SCR_SDEVn=43``), where ``n`` is the scripting serial"
" port number. Set ``RK9_SCRPORT=n`` to the same port number."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``SCR_SDEV_EN=1`` 以启用脚本串口，并将其中一个设置为 MAVLink High "
"Latency（``SCR_SDEVn=43``），其中 ``n`` 是脚本串口编号。将 ``RK9_SCRPORT=n`` 设置为同一端口号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:77
#: 0439b6e5cf4f4ebcb9589942cf3bd1d5 0ce5c94ce82b40ea81d45f8a0ae77bc6
#: 50cb11f3112445869b5a9b502595cc56 84469bdb34314cf3a01d5b7965c4e62c
#: cb1370a5ffae43ca9097a79275d4ab03
msgid ""
"Set ``RK9_RELAY=n`` to the relay output number ``RELAYn`` connected to the "
"RockBLOCK I_EN pin."
msgstr "将 ``RK9_RELAY=n`` 设置为连接到 RockBLOCK I_EN 引脚的继电器输出编号 ``RELAYn``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:78
#: 59fc7580a18f47f8a011f42d4bd92895 8eed2047f768458598afd9ce9baf0b1d
#: 99a4904b0afb410fa68a5f57c08e6e81 bfc13a4db4e3413789bfbe76b9aa3f11
#: dddb466845ac411ea282425b88314fdc
msgid ""
"Set ``RK9_BOOTED=n`` to the GPIO input number ``SERVOn`` connected to the "
"RockBLOCK I_BTD pin. Requires ``SERVOn_FUNCTION=-1`` (GPIO input)."
msgstr ""
"将 ``RK9_BOOTED=n`` 设为连接到 RockBLOCK I_BTD 引脚的 GPIO 输入编号 ``SERVOn`` 。需要 "
"``SERVOn_FUNCTION=-1`` （GPIO 输入）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:83
#: 0345b43e96b4447980ab4951f927ee3f 457e8164fd854fdbb649448d2189955f
#: 952f2702946b4e099de2fc8583d578a8 ee86f89b7bd7441a9ae36957e09bff4e
#: f2eb9bb988224386b75d60d7163ded61
msgid ""
"The RockBLOCK messages are sent and received via the Rock7 gateway. It has "
"an API that allows for sending and receiving messages via MQTT."
msgstr "RockBLOCK 消息通过 Rock7 网关收发。该网关提供 API，可通过 MQTT 收发消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:86
#: 2c70e06a0ab4499a8fe38d440c3b2934 5ba918b8fa114ee0bf09beeea0a0b488
#: 679b128bc2ba488dae2dcecec722d915 ed71d45eb5ae4030892dc6dbba0cd70f
#: f0407f51ea3e4883bd76abc35d10c4ca
msgid ""
"The `Rockblock2MAV <https://github.com/stephendade/rockblock2mav>`__ "
"software is a companion to the RockBlock Lua script. Use this software on "
"the GCS to send and receive MAVLink messages from the RockBLOCK modem via "
"the Cloudloop MQTT gateway."
msgstr ""
"`Rockblock2MAV <https://github.com/stephendade/rockblock2mav>`__ 软件是 "
"RockBlock Lua 脚本的配套软件。在地面站上使用该软件，可通过 Cloudloop MQTT 网关与 RockBLOCK 调制解调器收发 "
"MAVLink 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:95
#: 140dae6d7ff54b28bdb4e2487776b32d 29199f5664004c8987bd85e39bfcf726
#: 8c534623cb5b4bab80ec7365b830fdaf b678e1f22cc84624802f68cafa2ddb38
#: f99c674ddd01406cb83c5405ac98281a
msgid ""
"The RockBLOCK will do a mailbox check every ``RK9_PERIOD`` seconds. It will "
"send one `HIGH_LATENCY2 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HIGH_LATENCY2>`__ message and "
"receive one message from the GCS at this time."
msgstr ""
"RockBLOCK 每隔 ``RK9_PERIOD`` 秒进行一次邮箱检查。此时它会发送一条 `HIGH_LATENCY2 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HIGH_LATENCY2>`__ "
"消息，并从地面站接收一条消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:101
#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:181
#: 24e2d677f2ec4a1786cfb4b6cd8c01ba 44268ca4afd1499b815ba179ef85723b
#: 5af0d567c99b499babd0d4fc0fef0b0a 676128ceaa354ab6afdea612ba2584d0
#: 7a0d40a4dfe24088b2a353dc2bed3bcb 7bd15a7ececd41e7975225186e36e973
#: 8563d1da795b4c4d9057d6fb179f5bb7 c97d0a960a154c7096ca6853b79be981
#: d00c0ac39624461282977bccb15462c1 d6e6647aa4474a7ebbe45f0e4a372201
msgid ""
"Compared to terrestrial services (such as 4G Cellular), the RockBLOCK data "
"costs are expensive."
msgstr "与地面通信服务（如 4G 蜂窝网络）相比，RockBLOCK 的数据费用较为昂贵。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:103
#: 6069bf6e86fc43598c463dc20a7ab202 ab6b1bd7db08415497557110eff08f45
#: b9cfe061f12449daabb2418cb6108b7f d4938aa543d9462a96d1d85a74728b9c
#: ef9b8a0bd0ee4696bcbec1485904cf5b
msgid ""
"Current data costs are available from the `RockBlock website "
"<https://www.groundcontrol.com/product/rockblock-9704/>`__."
msgstr ""
"当前数据费用可在 `RockBlock 网站 "
"<https://www.groundcontrol.com/product/rockblock-9704/>`__ 查询。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:105
#: 1b015c94dccf44e482b06c8cfc9a9e0b 354817b90f4e4bdea3f067a62a7fff91
#: 6717f1a097ff438a917d6fcecabd59b5 d109357c980f459c8cd224619b480e8d
#: f379bee628aa472ead7bea42cff4801a
msgid ""
"Data is prepaid on a per-byte basis. Each ``HIGH_LATENCY2`` message sent or "
"received is 52 bytes. So, for example, if the RockBLOCK was configured to "
"send 1 ``HIGH_LATENCY2`` message every 30 seconds that would give a data "
"usage of 6.24 KB per hour. If any commands are sent from the GCS to the "
"vehicle via the RockBLOCK, they should be added too. For example, if 5 "
"commands are sent in the same hour, that is an additional 220 bytes. "
"Combining both sent and received messages, a total of 6.46 KB per hour are "
"used."
msgstr ""
"数据按字节预付费。每条发送或接收的 ``HIGH_LATENCY2`` 消息为 52 字节。例如，若将 RockBLOCK 配置为每 30 秒发送 1 "
"条 ``HIGH_LATENCY2`` 消息，则数据用量为每小时 6.24 KB。若通过 RockBLOCK "
"从地面站向载具发送任何指令，也应一并计入。例如，若同一小时内发送 5 条指令，则额外增加 220 字节。发送与接收消息合计，每小时共使用 6.46 "
"KB。"

