#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:145
#: 34fcd52e262e4695a2b53c7927fd83d8 571cf7680a404061a845a94b405c8211
#: 8ac06a067c2a4f818acdd89d931589a8 92e63e11370d4ba09fb3362d32f5512a
#: ce93c77c5c1548458e4a65cc2b85eefd
msgid ""
"The RockBLOCK 9603 has a latency of 20-60 seconds and is only able to send 1"
" message per 30 second period (or greater). This period is configurable via "
"the ``RCK_PERIOD`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"RockBLOCK 9603 的延迟为 20-60 秒，且每 30 秒（或更长）周期内只能发送 1 条消息。该周期可通过 ``RCK_PERIOD`` "
"参数配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:174
#: 1df02da2e46b46568721bb937f341c52 5e2918664a9147f9a24989c7fcfb38b9
#: 9752bf20529a49b6967cd8eb1b6c0f46 a0ef6f85249149d38f351ee0082bf97d
#: ebfab4b8172042ed9acf725fbae75e36
msgid ""
"The RockBLOCK will do a mailbox check every ``RCK_PERIOD`` seconds. It will "
"send one `HIGH_LATENCY2 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HIGH_LATENCY2>`__ message and "
"receive one message from the GCS at this time."
msgstr ""
"RockBLOCK 每隔 ``RCK_PERIOD`` 秒进行一次邮箱检查。此时它会发送一条 `HIGH_LATENCY2 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HIGH_LATENCY2>`__ "
"消息，并从地面站接收一条消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:185
#: 1ceede280a3142a0bc6c2a45288b9560 519748a6d0d34659985db2f91b45ceb9
#: 99183004390f4eaea9445b9bf73290a4 ad4d3e67f91d4d9f87553cbfcc8650c7
#: f958faa8e9ea4854a5b36e2908b1e059
msgid ""
"1 RockBLOCK credit is used per MAVLink message. So, for example, if the "
"RockBLOCK was configured to send 1 ``HIGH_LATENCY2`` message every 30 "
"seconds that would give a data usage of 120 credits per hour. If any "
"commands are sent from the GCS to the vehicle via the RockBLOCK, they should"
" be added too. For example, if 5 commands are sent in the same hour, 5 "
"credits are used. Combining both sent and received messages, a total of 125 "
"credits per hours are used."
msgstr ""
"每条 MAVLink 消息消耗 1 个 RockBLOCK 信用点。例如，若将 RockBLOCK 配置为每 30 秒发送 1 条 "
"``HIGH_LATENCY2`` 消息，则用量为每小时 120 个信用点。若通过 RockBLOCK "
"从地面站向载具发送任何指令，也应一并计入。例如，若同一小时内发送 5 条指令，则消耗 5 个信用点。发送与接收消息合计，每小时共使用 125 个信用点。"
